    "p.ratio.hint": ["1 = 圆笔尖；越小越扁，横竖粗细差越大", "1 = 圓筆尖；越小越扁，橫豎粗細差越大", "1 = round tip; lower is flatter, with a bigger difference between horizontal and vertical strokes", "1 = 丸いペン先。小さいほど平たく、縦横の太さの差が大きくなります", "1 = 둥근 펜촉. 작을수록 납작해져 가로·세로 굵기 차이가 커집니다", "1 = runde Spitze; kleiner = flacher, größerer Unterschied zwischen waagerecht und senkrecht", "1 = pointe ronde ; plus bas = plus plate, plus d'écart entre horizontales et verticales", "1 = punta redonda; menor = más plana, más diferencia entre horizontales y verticales"],
