    "srv.licFormat": ["激活码格式不对：应为 INK-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX", "啟用碼格式不對：應為 INK-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX", "Wrong code format: it should look like INK-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX", "コードの形式が違います：INK-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX の形式です", "코드 형식이 올바르지 않습니다: INK-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX 형식이어야 합니다", "Falsches Format: INK-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX", "Format incorrect : INK-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX attendu", "Formato incorrecto: debe ser INK-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX"],
    "srv.licInvalid": ["激活码无效，请核对后重新输入", "啟用碼無效，請核對後重新輸入", "Invalid activation code — please check and try again", "無効なコードです。確認して再入力してください", "유효하지 않은 코드입니다. 확인 후 다시 입력하세요", "Ungültiger Code – bitte prüfen und erneut eingeben", "Code invalide — vérifiez et réessayez", "Código no válido: revísalo e inténtalo de nuevo"],
